  "text": "## Documentation & Record Keeping  \n**What to Document:**\n- Date, time, location\n- People involved\n- Details of activity\n- Why you suspect violation\n- Actions taken\n- Outcome  \n**How Long to Keep:**\n- Customer files: 6 years after closure\n- Transaction records: 6 years\n- KYC/AML: 5–6 years\n- Suspicious activity reports: 5 years minimum  \n**Storage:**\n- Secure filing (locked cabinet)\n- Digital records encrypted\n- Access limited to authorized staff\n- Backed up regularly  \n---",
  "name": "Chunk 51/61",
  "_domain": "banking.communications",
